      "id": "far-jl-ledger-c4",
      "heading": "Example 4: the other ledger accounts",
      "explanation_md": "The remaining accounts on the handwritten pages:\n\n- **Purchases A/c:** debit June 12, 30,000 (from Gulmohar); balance c/d 30,000.\n- **Sales A/c:** credit 10,000 (Mohit Bros) and 15,000 (cash); balance c/d **25,000**.\n- **M/s Mohit Bros A/c:** debit June 20, 10,000 (sales); credit June 28, 10,000 (bank). Nothing is left owing.\n- **M/s Gulmohar F.H. A/c:** credit June 12, 30,000 (purchases); debit June 25, 30,000 (cash). Nothing is left owing.\n- **Salary A/c:** debit June 30, 6,000; balance c/d 6,000.\n- **Machines A/c:** debit June 12, 20,000; balance c/d 20,000.\n- **Rent A/c:** debit June 18, 5,000; balance c/d 5,000.\n\nThe two party accounts end at nil because each was settled in full.",
